{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55379","headline":"颂 · 文益","name":"颂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"理极忘情谓，如何有喻齐？\n到头霜夜月，任情（《林间录》作「运」）落前溪。\n菓熟猿兼（《林间录》作「兼猿」）重，山长似路迷。\n举头残照在，元是住居西。\n（《卍续藏经》本《大法眼文益禅师语录》，又见《林间录》卷下。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"文益","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55379.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55379","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}